      "side": 1,
      "message": "`donate_and_clear_host_page()` now takes `priv_num_pages`, but the unwind still gives back one page:\n\n```\n      err_with_state:\n              WARN_ON(__pkvm_hyp_donate_host(hyp_virt_to_pfn(priv_state), 1));\n```\n\nso on a failure below it the rest stay hyp-owned while the caller frees the whole allocation, and the next host user of those pages takes a stage-2 abort. Should this be `priv_num_pages`?",
      "revId": "35062e70491b0f6d1b2619b050348069ef86cf02",
